# NEVER COMMIT: the customer map snapshot is a local fallback cache generated from
# gravitee-io/cloud-deployments-configuration, which is PRIVATE. This repository is
# PUBLIC, so committing it would publish Gravitee's customer list and their
# infrastructure ids. Generate it locally with:
#   cd services/grafana-mcp-adapter && npm run refresh-customers
services/grafana-mcp-adapter/customers-snapshot.json
